// plan.md, and one helper per plan.md VOCABULARY item. Every helper takes the grid first and integer cells, and
// places real blocks with correct states through the build library. Facing = the LOW side of a stair (plan.md notes),
// so roof and step stairs face outward at an eave and up-slope at a rise.
